d<strong> discover</strong> all sorts of things like new building recipes, skins  or different magical trails to customize your little spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/extras/9983c1a7035327611f3747ccc54db830.avif?t=1786039689\" width=1438 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover</strong> nature’s synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>experiments</strong> or happy little accidents you  learn about powerful synergies between plants, animals and items. Some influence the visuals, others boost production or add more in-depth gameplay features. It’s up to you to <strong>discover and recreate</strong> them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/extras/3ea435d069142d08ef604d22ec6fa326.poster.avif?t=1786039689\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/extras/3ea435d069142d08ef604d22ec6fa326.webm?t=1786039689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/extras/3ea435d069142d08ef604d22ec6fa326.mp4?t=1786039689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gain</strong> new abilities and become more powerful</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome <strong>light platforming challenges</strong>, fulfill wishes to gain new movement abilities, make offerings to the <i>Great Mother for powerful blessings</i> and find new tools to shape the world around you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/extras/e420e640a94125f945d24ef486c5ba93.poster.avif?t=1786039689\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/extras/e420e640a94125f945d24ef486c5ba93.webm?t=1786039689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/extras/e420e640a94125f945d24ef486c5ba93.mp4?t=1786039689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play</strong> at your own pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With artsy and lush low-poly environments, cozy music and a natural ambient soundscape we created <i>Fuhon</i> as relaxing and creative outlet for players of all ages. There are no right or wrong ways to play this  game, <strong>we just want you to have a really good time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/extras/ec3ed6f7221b6b3064b72090b20f52d7.poster.avif?t=1786039689\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/extras/ec3ed6f7221b6b3064b72090b20f52d7.webm?t=1786039689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/extras/ec3ed6f7221b6b3064b72090b20f52d7.mp4?t=1786039689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/extras/32c1b66584572bed2d1fb5bd3705cdf0.avif?t=1786039689\" width=1438 height=138 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About us, the developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey guys, gals, and everyone in between and beyond! <br>We are tabicious and lucky, a nature-loving game dev couple based in Berlin. We have both been making games for almost a decade now and we realized that the industry has not been interested in making the kinds of games we are passionate about anymore.  So we started working on <strong>Fuhon</strong>, a game idea that has been following us throughout our careers, ever since we first met during our studies.<br><br>What began as a small passion project almost three years ago slowly grew into something  bigger. In 2025, while I worked in another studio, Lucky was able to work on Fuhon full-time through a German scholarship for game developers, and together we founded <strong>Twinleaf Studio</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuhon is still unfinished, a little wild in places, and very much growing, but it is full of our love for nature, cozy worlds, and playful creativity. We are working tirelessly towards our Demo release and hope to be able to show more this year, <strong>stay tuned and wishlist us NOW!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy exploring our little world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/extras/a62d3ab9c200b8f5388e2fa9c92fcc25.avif?t=1786039689\" width=1438 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Fuhon is a cozy nature-sandbox game about restoring a decaying world. Set out on this puzzle adventure to explore natures' many secrets, overcome light platforming challenges and discover the hidden synergies around you. Will you uncover what happened on these islands?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/a626e6a43d6c35e640976e24d5d3b81e54f14034/header.jpg?t=1786039689", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/faf3cc4325f1080a795cb4fc8b6cd4b4d6563955/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786039689", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/faf3cc4325f1080a795cb4fc8b6cd4b4d6563955/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786039689", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 3GHz or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce RTX 2060 or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Twinleaf Studio"], "publishers": ["Twinleaf Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 80, "description": "#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/599959d339cf4c2ef474755dd82bcb90feb2e9f3/ss_599959d339cf4c2ef474755dd82bcb90feb2e9f3.600x338.jpg?t=1786039689", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/599959d339cf4c2ef474755dd82bcb90feb2e9f3/ss_599959d339cf4c2ef474755dd82bcb90feb2e9f3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786039689"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230390/2dc3aa175d17e7ea7609175754a065e782052ed6/ss_2dc3aa175d17e7ea7609175754a065e782052ed6.600x338.jpg?t=1786039689", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/